abstract: >-
  An ns-3 simulation of PBFT-style consensus traffic sharing a Time-Sensitive
  Networking (IEEE 802.1Qbv) chain with a periodic control loop, comparing the
  time-aware shaper, strict priority and FIFO scheduling. Includes the
  experiment driver, analysis scripts, a Wireshark dissector and a
  reproducibility script that checks every run against reference results.
